@startuml
autonumber

title US105 - Update Aircraft Status — Simplified Sequence Diagram
actor "Air Transport Company Collaborator (ATCC)" as ATCC
participant ":System" as Sys

ATCC -> Sys: Requests to update an aircraft's operational status \n(providing registration number and new status)
Sys --> ATCC: Updates the status and displays a confirmation message

@enduml